    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but healing feels like a lie. how can you \"heal\" when the foundation is just gone? it feels more like a slow, painful decay. sometimes i think it would be more dignified to just leave before the decay is complete. like, why wait for the nothingness to take me if i can just choose to go now?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
